# VoiceVision Conclusions
# Source: Architecture synthesis

## C-600: Reusable Component Architecture
VoiceVision is a reusable Python component ("lego brick") for offline multimodal AI on the edge.
- Core: VAD→STT→LLM→filter→TTS pipeline
- Vision: camera→Moondream→LLM→TTS
- All models as subprocesses (ADR-001/002)
- Library, not application - caller owns context, models, audio devices
- Optional HTTP server (localhost only) for integrations
- Ubuntu 22.04+ and Raspberry Pi OS support

